  "bio": "Victor Gomes is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Belo Horizonte, Brazil, with a specialization in the black and gray style. He has garnered acclaim for his meticulous attention to detail and his exceptional ability to bring depth and realism into every piece he creates. Victor's dedication to his craft is evident in the stunning, nuanced work he produces, making him a sought-after artist for those looking to adorn their skin with monochromatic masterpieces.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Belo Horizonte, Minas Gerais, Brazil",
